=== NATURAL ===
DEFINE DATA PARAMETER
1 #FIRST (A10)
1 #LAST  (A10)
1 #FULL  (A20)
END-DEFINE
COMPRESS #FIRST #LAST INTO #FULL LEAVING NO SPACE

=== PYTHON ===
class CompressLeavingNoSpaceContext:
    def __init__(self):
        self.first = ""
        self.last = ""
        self.full = ""

def execute_compress_leaving_no_space(ctx: CompressLeavingNoSpaceContext, session):
    ctx.full = ''.join([str(ctx.first), str(ctx.last)])
    return ctx

=== EXECUTE ===
- input:
    first: "John"
    last: "Doe"
  expected:
    full: "JohnDoe"

- input:
    first: "ABC"
    last: "123"
  expected:
    full: "ABC123"
